menu "Chibi"
choice CHIBI_BOARD
    prompt "Board revision"
    default CHIBI_BOARD_V2
    help
        Waveshare changed the board's power and touch wiring in June 2026 (V2 / Rev1.1).
        Look at the back of your board: "Rev1.1" or "V2" means V2.
    config CHIBI_BOARD_V2
        bool "V2 / Rev1.1 (shipped from 8 June 2026)"
    config CHIBI_BOARD_V1
        bool "V1 (original)"
endchoice
endmenu
